Description: Train and validate binary classifiers based on pair-wise
    feature comparisons using the K-Top-Scoring-Pair (KTSP) algorithm.
    The KTSP classifier uses the relative ordering of feature values
    (e.g. gene expression levels) to make predictions, making it robust
    to data normalization and producing transparent decision rules. The
    package supports feature filtering, restricted pair selection,
    cross-validation, and various performance evaluation methods.
